{"density":2.8125,"scaledDensity":2.8125,"fontScale":1,"texts":[{"text":"She lies about having a boyfriend, then hires her annoying neighbor.","box":[248,-2043,787,200],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"What format would you like for your video?","box":[45,-1775,990,53],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"1. Video language: English\n2. Captions: Yes, include captions","box":[365,-1697,670,200],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_item_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"I'll create a drama based on this template — give me a moment...","box":[45,-1429,990,110],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":2,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_agent_text","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Story Outline & Characters Result","box":[45,-1263,990,46],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_header","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Story Outline","box":[90,-1138,900,40],"color":"#FF454B55","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_label","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"【A Rash Lie】\nCornered in the hallway by an intrusive colleague, Claire impulsively fabricates a fiercely protective boyfriend to make him back off.\n\n【The Smug Witness】\nClaire's annoying neighbor Liam steps out of his apartment having overheard every word, amused by her reckless fiction.\n\n【A Desperate Offer】\nClaire swallows her pride and attempts to hire Liam to act as her date for an upcoming work dinner.\n\n【Setting the Price】\nLiam rejects her cash offer and instead demands public favors and daily chore duties in exchange for his acting services.\n\n【Sealing the Pact】\nClaire reluctantly agrees to Liam's ridiculous rules, cementing their counterfeit relationship with a strict handshake.\n\n【An Unannounced Arrival】\nBefore they can rehearse their backstory, Claire's suspicious colleague knocks loudly on her door demanding to meet the new boyfriend.\n\nPossible Characters:\n• Claire — Female lead, corporate marketing associate\n• Liam — Male lead, freelance architectural designer across the hall\n• Marcus — Supporting character, intrusive office coworker","box":[90,-1053,900,1892],"color":"#FF000000","px":39,"sp":13.87,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":36,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_body","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Characters Result","box":[90,932,900,40],"color":"#FF454B55","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_outline_characters_label","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimary"},{"text":"Claire","box":[90,1276,248,40],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Liam","box":[372,1276,248,40],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"Marcus","box":[654,1276,248,40],"color":"#FF000000","px":34,"sp":12.09,"weight":400,"style":"normal","family":"sans-serif","lines":1,"id":"id/text_mini_drama_character_result_name","window":0,"res":"@color/textPrimaryHigh"},{"text":"I have created the characters for Borrowed Boyfriend, introducing Claire, Liam, and Marcus.",